C Non-equilibrium thermodynamics
C.1 Dissipation, lag, and the information gap
Eq. (15) is a Jarzynski equality, applied to Langevin dynamics. Assuming p0 ≈ p(0)
eq so that we can ignore the KL between them, Eq. (15) is
Stot = DKL pd p(T )
eq . (70)
